  "description": "IGOFAM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H115 O25 Tb5. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.580-5.110 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.72-159.24°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H115Tb5O25. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
